  clock: 3  # 9ef0
  nonce: 9ef0  # 9ef0
  message: "Superseded by WI-lokuv auto-import design (decision recorded in WI-lokuv's discuss log on 2026-04-22). Under auto-import, io_primitives.env_read entries (which already declare os.environ, sys.argv via attributes: and os.getenv via functions:) are symmetrically derived into TaintSource records with default label=host_secret. The WI-jojis-original-scope data-model extension to add attribute kind to TaintSource becomes redundant because the auto-import path consumes IoPrimitive objects directly — IoPrimitive already supports kind=attribute since WI-guhok. The narrow WI-jojis implementation would have been throwaway work against the auto-import end state."  # 9ef0
